  "title": "Jalapeño Potatoes",
  "description": "This jalapeño potatoes recipe with sharp Cheddar cheese have a slight kick from the jalapeños. The pimento and jalapeños add a nice color contrast, too.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
